#: scenario7:scenario7_A96CAE13_9C7E_4730_98AB_0871D301A47C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 877ae6f7683fa2024d394597218631dea2a1cc46330588d9970e568fe61e7273
#. default-sha256: 8d5640c59181bcd86de933482691b65ced6cdd537acf2bf66e69779d21b9adb5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A96CAE13_9C7E_4730_98AB_0871D301A47C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"The next thing I know, I’m sinking into a vast void."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"Tutto a un tratto, mi ritrovo a sprofondare nel vuoto."

#: scenario7:scenario7_90291295_72F6_4C51_BFC6_381BD6CEF353
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfa08484eb9b80f3bfcd4a97967f2c0296674b190a1648cc5ccac836e5acb055
#. default-sha256: 874f2a1a70a862dce92525421a768ac4d35570c26be7f7828cf43130adf3bdf6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_90291295_72F6_4C51_BFC6_381BD6CEF353"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Darkness cuffs my hands and legs, restricting my movement."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le tenebre mi bloccano mani e piedi, ostacolando i miei movimenti."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2AD5BC36_5471_4DAF_8C37_9DDE094511FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 707630001b9ace4eb105b5231de6662771e1f242a18136486853b43280ed7947
#. default-sha256: f299e4886e8eedb2c0c8c1f17203932ff988db988b0f1cfcd6ffe8b5cee989b6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2AD5BC36_5471_4DAF_8C37_9DDE094511FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Images of the past I had kept buried away for so long stream past me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Immagini del passato che avevo sepolto per tanto tempo mi scorrono davanti."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BA656386_6B5A_407B_A461_559136048884
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1c0cb50dc48265b136574bbf20c287cb5b046984cacad4e66dd6f51efe30eb5
#. default-sha256: 43a2d30e873499ac5cea6b1b5f9b41829e3554c58ea9354f3aeffd9ff3d58665
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BA656386_6B5A_407B_A461_559136048884"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This isn’t how I wanted it to happen."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non è così che volevo che accadesse."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F4B7AAC7_8F40_40E8_B4DC_DAA38BFB6CEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35a9a73a2e392cf6cdf41cf189f2e08d6e437107d78c0278689cc246ea25753d
#. default-sha256: acbf6308576f7ec970d6fa6c388af71413fa47a3a4d52710bebd51ca23889c16
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F4B7AAC7_8F40_40E8_B4DC_DAA38BFB6CEF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not coming from my own mouth, but being laid bare for all to see without my consent."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Che, anziché uscire dalla mia bocca, venissero messe a nudo sotto agli occhi di tutti senza "
"il mio consenso."

#: scenario7:scenario7_88540E0B_4C1F_4535_B178_8FF75C778400
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acab78d0cd013253e824f1b94461ee810bf119ead780989251bf0f936cb4c623
#. default-sha256: def02b7e337f491b8eace9717bbe9a2fb131392c1376fb8d41ab96c108193df5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_88540E0B_4C1F_4535_B178_8FF75C778400"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That wasn’t how I wanted her to find out about my secret.⟪k:1⟫About my shameful history."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non è così che volevo che lei scoprisse il mio segreto.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il mio disonorevole passato."

#: scenario7:scenario7_011499B5_A734_4A7F_BADA_EECA71EE1258
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63623b1b412fd828ca242ff28527698f10ddec90b35fc2beb4a8c91b3c83055a
#. default-sha256: 1f999a383ebed9c255cd7ed792985524dcbdf8f9b61162f7a81a6efa6e3fa94d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_011499B5_A734_4A7F_BADA_EECA71EE1258"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I warned you, my dear.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I told you you didn’t want to reclaim your old self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ti avevo avvertito, mio caro.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Te l’avevo detto di non reclamare te stesso."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DF7DD3A0_BC0F_4C5C_B3F1_B44B778C1EB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 774406d69779a0ec3f428546eb01e39e13abfebf72224bfe7d0c0f9b4afd2c65
#. default-sha256: ef21861c6d9b1a040e1b4529c5b3624345c739794c3f509217301bb4f3ebdccc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DF7DD3A0_BC0F_4C5C_B3F1_B44B778C1EB2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you had simply let it be, you wouldn’t be here now, forced to relive it all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se avessi semplicemente lasciato perdere,⟪k:1⟫ora non saresti qui, costretto a rivivere ogni "
"cosa."

#: scenario7:scenario7_26AA5245_B7EF_4A45_A834_0B33AE52C6D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 19c79e7071ac6e51c28e54759e8b18fd318b5a8b28743bbeae4c1eddb61054b0
#. default-sha256: be5b202f1c35e94c7b4952b2379d12af493ea8b85f2053fd3e8444144cb7cb6b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_26AA5245_B7EF_4A45_A834_0B33AE52C6D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now do you understand?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The tale I spun behind the fourth door...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was as "
"much for you as it was for her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Capisci adesso?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il racconto dietro la quarta porta...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫l’ho creato sia per "
"te che per lei."

#: scenario7:scenario7_549F9556_6FFA_41FE_A2D5_02D9825633E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3993cfd78fc660b47557bceda06150fe5d927d057e82f0a1d2d9bb21db3e389e
#. default-sha256: 5b865269501f9a7c7bec90b5d0b913eeaf7921e595ddaffbcbe08a9c68f5df23
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_549F9556_6FFA_41FE_A2D5_02D9825633E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There, you were a young man with a sad fate,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Lì, eri un giovane uomo con un triste destino,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_81DF8018_C7B1_483D_A0A1_1FAD77647BF9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90ca1fed89a6c8a22af2cf7f6daffccee47947ae59149f726ae0d2d4e2ce37f8
#. default-sha256: 4409081d93d2fc3d02ef861ee0e3cb0834a024ba44d3a693f2845f7b158dd103
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_81DF8018_C7B1_483D_A0A1_1FAD77647BF9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but you met a wonderful woman, fell in love with her,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ma hai conosciuto una donna bellissima, te ne sei innamorato,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_782DC1D8_EFC8_40C7_A723_4689DB8A74F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bc44a7881d379a5add928dd3a9d16082ec0fdd1bf6a3f0117db17d54f1fa23a
#. default-sha256: 73ebce9de21ffa8abc02416851bc8f184540f4bb5d99a80b9e83907f60db5634
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_782DC1D8_EFC8_40C7_A723_4689DB8A74F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and then died in the arms of tragedy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e sei poi morto tra le braccia della disgrazia."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6A27B7F1_BF1F_48E8_9185_3B6D50AA5242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06e0a32c679c1b228f0abd43f784c6f7b6e55a0a0ca86a7ee5de718acf476025
#. default-sha256: 3fc4413d356b1816bf75d393a9ac06799c17c022c1127e441fb5e87d6bf02aa5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6A27B7F1_BF1F_48E8_9185_3B6D50AA5242"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sequence of events is not far from the truth, but I was able to turn it into something "
"enchanting and beautiful."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Questa serie di eventi non si discosta più di tanto dalla verità,⟪k:1⟫ma ho trasformato la "
"tua storia in qualcosa di splendido ed incantevole."

#: scenario7:scenario7_7DAC9D9F_91D2_4E0A_B9B9_ACA1FDE69FA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 949b16d1bcdcdf9eba18b63b150de45390a6e2ce755c19c9f89033dc8bf5805a
