#: scenario7:scenario7_AC7D6F8D_2FF8_4974_8F51_9EE8A1E9B614
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59cf96d8b758fce523fec8323c8f8de4863f03a8ae3b9e203a53c63d595701ee
