msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ci eravamo lasciati alle spalle le strade pavimentate da un bel po’.⟪k:1⟫Il carro dondolava "
"avanti e indietro, mentre procedeva lungo la strada sterrata."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F0C6902E_68FE_4483_BBB0_C7DD7DF9C42B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a9400ee074767299fdcd2df8b70166540243c2b753eed11580a8728c4310eb7
#. default-sha256: 493b76228b2587ff13a0127567aa417fa81538f1338659992cce8afe9de65cd1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F0C6902E_68FE_4483_BBB0_C7DD7DF9C42B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For hours, I stared through the window as unfamiliar scenery flowed past."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Rimasi a guardare per ore il paesaggio sconosciuto che mi scorreva davanti, oltre il "
"finestrino."

#: scenario7:scenario7_79A48CB2_9C49_44A6_B40B_44E15C9C445D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a4cc60e5ee557e58c958601c9f2d9a6243d8376fbd1c9fbd17410756ea773fd
#. default-sha256: 1827cafd248b6b8608063afada993d9d387bb3897c63985f62cb72e2630d8c31
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_79A48CB2_9C49_44A6_B40B_44E15C9C445D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Eventually, a fog settled over the area, making it difficult to discern night from day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ben presto, i dintorni vennero ricoperti dalla nebbia,⟪k:1⟫rendendo difficile distinguere il "
"giorno e la notte."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0E088A47_52C1_4581_B41B_BF40C33F08E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc5a8fd2b5c62dd663d77bb2d88112506056a317fac68d5048ff25fd84dc2cab
#. default-sha256: 4617b060f27d13933ec4cf2147ed0f59b68e1bf4fd4c02a1df0cf743fcc001d8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0E088A47_52C1_4581_B41B_BF40C33F08E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We made our way through dark, dense woods,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ci facemmo strada attraverso una foresta fitta e oscura,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_359143BE_5C80_42FC_B167_2C23C3273733
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5be4dc074143066b42c44502235bfdc44054130838ec344289d2dce9d34ef19d
#. default-sha256: bbe8ddc50898dff73d27e798a326ad17c3a94a0a5f52b44f55c516e837d1e142
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_359143BE_5C80_42FC_B167_2C23C3273733"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and beyond them, like the world fading into view after a dream,⟪k:1⟫a mansion appeared "
"before us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫oltre la quale, come il mondo che riemerge dopo un sogno,⟪k:1⟫apparve una villa."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DC8ACA79_CAB1_4942_82B7_958A94631B2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5aebffc6cc4b25f43935e022549367e057b6e72b438ebf9fed0b83786b5e5bb6
#. default-sha256: 44531afa34e5ae0804f10025a52a06696102b6a0c0a1cac04de1d08e1087cfe2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DC8ACA79_CAB1_4942_82B7_958A94631B2D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All the windows were either shuttered or boarded, encasing the house in darkness. "
"⟪k:3⟫In a way, it felt like all I had done was move from one prison to a much larger one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Le finestre erano tutte o chiuse o sbarrate, avvolgendo la casa nelle tenebre. "
"⟪k:3⟫In un certo senso, era come se mi avessero trasferito da una prigione ad una molto più "
"grande."

#: scenario7:scenario7_07AD7681_D31A_46C2_A2B1_605FBAB4690C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0df95a529b616fa102af560c963e2057a9fb22bf6071cd88a564b7afb1fd8375
#. default-sha256: f4ced13e0c0ae973a49e65f9d179122ff04a1004a37e96417a41151977dd357e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_07AD7681_D31A_46C2_A2B1_605FBAB4690C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Briefly, I thought they had possibly been sealed to keep anyone from seeing me inside, but "
"my coming here was a very recent development."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per un momento, pensai che le avessero sigillate per impedire a chiunque di vedermi "
"all’interno, ma il mio arrivo lì era uno sviluppo piuttosto recente."

#: scenario7:scenario7_09D5BBD6_AEEE_44A9_A23E_95B5BEA18C65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7dfdca8002ab46763a467140c523957a0ea2c38bcaad405be2715933bf926d5
#. default-sha256: 3d0566fe8b32815ef1365186ce9a91484cbd4545526f2973f863ac30a3ce837d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_09D5BBD6_AEEE_44A9_A23E_95B5BEA18C65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫More likely, then, the house had been in this condition when it was initially purchased."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era più probabile che la casa si trovasse già in quelle condizioni quando era stata "
"acquistata."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E5FACC8E_63AE_45FE_84F5_08E44CF718B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5cdd59cc7307e28b11bc99b70495ae2bc4c943cd0977c8b0ff8e6463127ff691
#. default-sha256: bbe05c6f37e8f0ba9121eaebe7357361842d43c552c58786fd27e9daac88cb0f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E5FACC8E_63AE_45FE_84F5_08E44CF718B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quite the piece of property my father had found himself with.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wondered if he had "
"been swindled by its previous owner."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Che strana proprietà che aveva trovato, mio padre.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mi chiesi se fosse stato "
"truffato dal precedente proprietario."

#: scenario7:scenario7_10E4132C_00D0_407E_BB98_0B0A7C2D8AAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b35cd03ef4e5b20a4d0ade39faf71af2a5eaac7eb0fb6816808c9f3f68fb0194
#. default-sha256: 62dcade4ce67b07ed801df212130179550e2f59ab9033a16281af05fcbfd8003
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_10E4132C_00D0_407E_BB98_0B0A7C2D8AAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was a gloomy, uninviting place, but it didn’t appear to be in disrepair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era un luogo tetro e poco invitante, ma non sembrava in rovina."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A61028F2_141A_4513_ADDB_0512E02AD2E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91bc5c76d9049e5671a8c66d2bcd7318be71da53de58d2c26b61450ef0dc4468
#. default-sha256: 22e3151b4c441ddba2688c65c3133509d58d71fee6476ec30386a0fe05958531
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A61028F2_141A_4513_ADDB_0512E02AD2E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The coachman left my luggage outside the door, gave me an empty farewell, and then went "
"on his way."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Il cocchiere lasciò il bagaglio fuori dalla porta, mi salutò freddamente, e se ne andò "
"per la sua strada."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3DC55A11_A712_4E8A_8838_C3E23C0B0603
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c17faa67c01fce93b6757441550b075d4550225f363e263b6467e17eb2ab94c
#. default-sha256: 7c58e776186fa607c035923f3a8f690ec86f376f31d0c0fbd7c8bd00d9475649
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3DC55A11_A712_4E8A_8838_C3E23C0B0603"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was... ⟪k:1⟫entirely alone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ero... ⟪k:1⟫completamente solo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_482E3049_2539_49D9_B7CA_842612330E9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
