msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A85997A7_0A43_4642_A58B_D0231ACAB0AB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a140acde5967ca44e57ef374905bc737a7dc252f79555a85d221b3e85ecc648
#. default-sha256: 086fa3cdb1465ba6a02320e26c6f5280d588144ccddb9de04c59b8c22d31f336
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A85997A7_0A43_4642_A58B_D0231ACAB0AB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I spent some time just staring out at the forest, but naturally, there was nothing of "
"interest to be found there. ⟪k:1⟫So I quietly turned around and opened the door to the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per un po’ rimasi ad osservare la foresta, ma naturalmente, non c’era niente di interessante "
"da vedere. ⟪k:1⟫Così mi voltai in silenzio e aprii il portone della villa."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1F5B5544_F2BD_4AE1_B168_AD9BCD0A2CC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbf92982ded5799e1b87c8c28d1616372852a297deb56f9b4e2ab6230d9b055f
#. default-sha256: 6b62398303d034aa961025d31082e57309a120602fca47cfecb0f7f391102a09
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1F5B5544_F2BD_4AE1_B168_AD9BCD0A2CC4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It’s certainly dark..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫È⟪k:10⟫ davvero buio..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A39B9906_8B03_44F8_9562_BC3F44C5F944
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39767b99cba3e5a404400a636b2a5eede4d8e0f4d61361dd1074d231a31b2329
#. default-sha256: 94af1af6dcf6e1d05dfa2fc2ce652b7b947dfb86f459e0b21e46aa819981b898
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A39B9906_8B03_44F8_9562_BC3F44C5F944"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I could barely even see my own feet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Riuscivo a malapena a vedermi i piedi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FA3122C7_CEF1_4641_81FC_8FC5C9F108D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6514f39e780e906d8df1a96daf708c19cfc42de333eddeda973ca1f69c10fec8
#. default-sha256: 13269f478f00003e2cd121712276458a2e0725df8236582478ac8019477296d0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FA3122C7_CEF1_4641_81FC_8FC5C9F108D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Briefly, I considered trying to unshutter a window or two, but ended up deciding against it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Per un istante, pensai di provare ad aprire qualche finestra, ma finii per rinunciare."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6F10B502_63D0_40A0_A785_24C01EE28C1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9d1814183b7cc17aa5e48ca7360eb8f683c8b1e40370954dfe9cd4fd4e4943e
#. default-sha256: c99d37f0f026f4c245a6cfd9c43072464451d788105cd9e889341f09b7928a72
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6F10B502_63D0_40A0_A785_24C01EE28C1D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The less inviting the place looked, the easier it would be for me to avoid contact with the "
"outside world, as Didier had recommended."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Meno invitante quel posto sarebbe apparso, più facile sarebbe stato evitare ogni contatto "
"col mondo esterno, così come Didier mi aveva raccomandato."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0E767C7_7129_413F_9DE2_47181008E1FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e968099ff865a507bc31db7e90679eabcc0e884bfb83998a72cc2a8e3121a86
#. default-sha256: a1b8a74bfe115ef31f1b03f9032e89f4f0cfcd8edbc85cf33a91f1a73c29c0c0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0E767C7_7129_413F_9DE2_47181008E1FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Standing there in the darkness for several minutes, my eyes gradually grew accustomed to the "
"lack of light. ⟪k:1⟫While it was hardly ideal, it was sufficient to take a look around the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Standomene lì al buio per alcuni minuti, i miei occhi si abituarono gradualmente all’assenza "
"di luce. ⟪k:1⟫Sebbene non fosse l’ideale,⟪k:2⟫era sufficiente per dare un’occhiata alla casa."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9CE09A1E_68E6_4052_BB90_4836A61A2BFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 720733124cd5cfdc47837bbc47f6aed7587b6fa0d588890551beb7772d36bbc7
#. default-sha256: d4b322fbd79b9db1a0d7555a50a36b3f8d804be3fbe6d2fe7c5c3402160af9ce
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9CE09A1E_68E6_4052_BB90_4836A61A2BFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The inside didn’t seem to have received the same level of care as the outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"everything was dusty and the air was many years stale. ⟪k:3⟫But I wasn’t in a cleaning mood,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Gli interni parevano non aver ricevuto la stessa cura dell’esterno—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫era tutto "
"impolverato e l’aria era stantia. ⟪k:4⟫Ma non ero in vena di pulizie,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_776F7F6F_F659_4AD0_AFE7_A4C0D33DD587
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a80026c18ab969c7b8df60ee11eee88119552bf7263a26a01d5ad5a1049e629
