msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quella è..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9C229545_33D1_471B_BC3C_74EEADDDC7E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
