msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Examining the large room I found myself in,⟪k:9⟫I "
"came across a stained-glass window depicting an angel."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Esaminando la grande stanza in cui mi ero ritrovato, "
"vidi una finestra in vetro colorato che raffigurava un angelo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BABA6C9B_0ECB_4777_BA6C_CD417E6912E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0cb2739a8a088f79c3679ee2adfd72604811828ad0b4f64688aa3486ad461ba
#. default-sha256: 17183efc7a4f8d21bd679133520e0cbeba76a2298802f7203bfbfa421e511007
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BABA6C9B_0ECB_4777_BA6C_CD417E6912E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The archangel—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫after whom I had been named—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫looked solemnly down upon me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’arcangelo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫da cui avevo ripreso il nome—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫mi osservava con sguardo "
"solenne."

#: scenario7:scenario7_BD94362B_1353_4109_AA78_C4B97929DB77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9c5d528999df497244a2c99ec1befa50c8f16c4be46993ba8edd921c0d17698
#. default-sha256: 54ea1c19f7573d358af9012701259ad8e4e1e68c9fe0fe7dde283ad082ddeef6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BD94362B_1353_4109_AA78_C4B97929DB77"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Quite the joke..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Divertente..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C10A023F_4B0A_4751_8C7D_7C56438A7F74
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57dc68c25434c313b20a503d12e600a8c24d408f506a96ea40da9a215b61dae4
