msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With every step I took, I could hear my joints creaking and my muscles screaming. ⟪k:1⟫I was "
"long since out of breath, only staying upright with the help of the wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ad ogni mio passo, potevo sentire le mie ossa scricchiolare e i miei muscoli gridare. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Ero ormai senza fiato, e riuscivo a reggermi solo grazie al sostegno della parete."

