msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Layers upon layers of it, making its intent abundantly clear:⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫nothing shall come in "
"or out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Strati su strati di corda facevano chiaramente capire il loro intento:⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫nulla "
"sarebbe entrato né uscito da lì."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9F78DD61_1E34_4ABE_B6FC_2540C72556E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e24c330b590792585c7bcff018cebae11a57cca518b84a2f3651a5d2ae3f3c49
