msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It didn’t look like it had been put there recently either, as much of it was rotted through."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non sembrava nemmeno che fosse stata messa lì da poco,⟪k:1⟫essendo perlopiù consumata."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C3AC18F6_58B8_4279_8235_3EA9E83F1946
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a79e2006beaa0c9f1d10c12523cfd24317ae0a084246b01bfaa98404bec60383
