msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Out of curiosity, I grabbed at the coil and yanked. ⟪k:1⟫The rope snapped in several places, "
"chunks falling limply to the floor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Preso dalla curiosità afferrai il groviglio, e lo strattonai.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫La corda si spezzò in "
"vari punti, e alcuni brandelli caddero a terra fiaccamente."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DC5C2DD6_D103_4F1A_B967_A5431CE27C3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
