#: scenario7:scenario7_51DCB9CC_6E8E_42C4_8554_30033FB1D66E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ab586f9b86eff5bb7d7edb1774723ac55cd041c6595b07beb89992402b108dd
