msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_51DCB9CC_6E8E_42C4_8554_30033FB1D66E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫People only sealed doors like this for a reason.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Largely because they didn’t want—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫or couldn’t allow—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫others to see what hid behind them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La gente sigillava porte come quella per una ragione.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Principalmente perché non "
"voleva—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫o non poteva permettere—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫che altri vedessero cosa si nascondesse "
"al loro interno."

#: scenario7:scenario7_EFBE9BDB_947B_4FC3_9618_3B24BBCEDAF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cec4dbd8dc689c2cdaf1f9ac2bcf6da5748fec9b4cae78d139e0fdf602a0d484
#. default-sha256: 5a0225673bc4d16e4f017d0611f88149b7777e4b52687468e8c5cad2fe3fdbbf
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EFBE9BDB_947B_4FC3_9618_3B24BBCEDAF3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Like... ⟪k:1⟫what they did to me..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Proprio come hanno fatto con me..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_728A6837_89EF_4241_B76C_9F3FEAF28F75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9070c3183c61d7387b5408ddf793f23b6a16c2effa9e6591e848d05c41a968de
#. default-sha256: 914482266ae66c77087454c8fa08d9f47d86273b5c884a6e4273857d4eb83709
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_728A6837_89EF_4241_B76C_9F3FEAF28F75"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For a few moments, I felt as though I was looking down at myself from outside my body."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Per un momento, sentii come se mi stessi guardando da fuori."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B5C26BBE_5178_4E85_A329_F553B3539AEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ea2d2a675e29b45433291f240d959eedd3eca9202880fc7f9e6fea597ec95b0
#. default-sha256: 5b9cb8bb9dc5b9aeba163fc6d4489c837dbc0a691f57caeec4093cbd968efa39
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B5C26BBE_5178_4E85_A329_F553B3539AEC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If it hadn’t been this man, but someone else standing there, would they have turned back at "
"the sight of the sealed-off door, acting as though nothing was there?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se lì non ci fosse stato quell’uomo, ma qualcun altro, si sarebbe voltato alla vista della "
"porta sigillata, facendo finta di non aver visto niente?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_79C85BEE_7A70_41D5_AC66_0C21C8DFCBED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e6c2a26776fc4d94f18dc534b1740e05c9296564d133556b172183d17bedfb6
#. default-sha256: 4a4938ce184c67c3998efd8889606c92ea4b3ad631aced932a60d83389c410bb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_79C85BEE_7A70_41D5_AC66_0C21C8DFCBED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or would they have done as I did?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O avrebbe fatto come me?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B8A8FA78_1517_45D2_9C5B_A93BEE0D427E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cdcc54c366e9a2d491c5f5883a24f38e209e9a1d3a1c86718c44bccdb5c6bb5
#. default-sha256: 64196cd36dd67ba2f996d7111412c3fdbbcb6e7134f660e4a8de765a223fc9b0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B8A8FA78_1517_45D2_9C5B_A93BEE0D427E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I ground my teeth, a mix of annoyance and bitterness rushing through me. ⟪k:1⟫But I did not "
"hesitate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Digrignai i denti, attraversato da un misto di fastidio e amarezza.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma non esitai."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A78D05F7_6C43_432D_9E44_98144973FE40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f511249c9ab3c531c4d9637e6008688bf617ea98259edbfeb8f3e69dfc46bc8d
#. default-sha256: 027f5b37dbe57392323d1d5cf48c2d56871d1b79ec838120169c922dc534039f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A78D05F7_6C43_432D_9E44_98144973FE40"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I held the flame of the candle up to the wall of rope, careful not to set the whole thing "
"ablaze, slowly, carefully burning through them one by one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mantenni la fiamma della candela contro il muro di funi, facendo attenzione a non mettere "
"fuoco a tutto, bruciando i nodi lentamente, uno ad uno."

#: scenario7:scenario7_24A6F4EE_AA47_44AA_999F_D6B8D99FA06A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac04c6772d74cc5ff3236d47b10f155828669858150404f265205f49fe44e191
#. default-sha256: c9dacf91599a6128b79e7298fcb17aa121f052f10879eae8afa84afbaeb70b79
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_24A6F4EE_AA47_44AA_999F_D6B8D99FA06A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was repetitive and time-consuming, but I persisted, wiping away sheets of sweat before it "
"streamed into my eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era ripetitivo e richiese del tempo, ma persistetti, asciungando via il sudore prima che "
"potesse colarmi negli occhi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FAA81D06_4D31_4A9D_9403_1BA0C235AE10
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4131dba17af3f237409804d90450458ba0ae8e6d9a264b0489b292f443759867
#. default-sha256: 1c6c5a33f73dcdc3f2d1fda9b58a41ffc28218e101cdb4c99f756948a31649b0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FAA81D06_4D31_4A9D_9403_1BA0C235AE10"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sun was well on its way down before I finally managed to expose the door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il sole aveva cominciato a tramontare ancor prima che fossi riuscito finalmente a rivelare "
"la porta."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D9FBA03F_AD98_4FFF_A59C_19DF67DC3B0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3409365172455e6c0200c40157164fe8e8b5e45c4f427b3e9efb7be6aec8f460
#. default-sha256: 9d280646c22942024aad25463bf10e44b115bc16d2706fc9eab5884ce30309cc
