msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non molto, probabilmente..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_51EE7D7E_C2F2_4960_B156_BC5FD7AB4C4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb8623b7723f506c30eccf5f1b72ade2b72e5789478e86c50792d485d4b1b919
#. default-sha256: f23e8faaa4ab68e33133860491b5f14c73c6171022c51e64345b070c91ff39c2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_51EE7D7E_C2F2_4960_B156_BC5FD7AB4C4F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I spent enough time alone in that dark mansion to drive anyone mad."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Avevo trascorso talmente tanto tempo da solo in quella villa oscura che "
"chiunque al mio posto sarebbe impazzito."

#: scenario7:scenario7_728DAE21_C534_4503_A197_67DA6AB13F39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22158c514b475221a686bc693e2c6ba49abfbf4f34156c8a31eb5573880fb1f4
#. default-sha256: a422aba6e91ba633774760bb27ba1d43fa59e51c0f33fe73987db0260ec4d6e4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_728DAE21_C534_4503_A197_67DA6AB13F39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more time that passed, the more I grew to question myself—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫my worth as a "
"human being."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Più tempo passava, più mettevo in dubbio me stesso...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫e il mio valore in quanto "
"essere umano."

#: scenario7:scenario7_05DCCE77_2C9B_446E_A26A_9A2D2037DAA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21812e0092ef880e438d4c91484d4ef52ee2a06dbd9051c0ee2365de91db27a8
#. default-sha256: 7ebdb57489aebf31656c1f2bd743a63bb81083c41e58971e683b522e82b712a0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_05DCCE77_2C9B_446E_A26A_9A2D2037DAA0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And whenever the self-doubt and -loathing became too much to take...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I trekked up "
"to the top of the observation tower to see the light."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E ogniqualvolta l’incertezza e il disprezzo nei miei stessi confronti diventavano troppo "
"grandi da sopportare...⟪k:1⟫ mi incamminavo verso⟪k:2⟫la cima della torre d’osservazione per "
"osservare la luce."

#: scenario7:unlabelled:scenario7_05DCCE77_2C9B_446E_A26A_9A2D2037DAA0:1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 966ddd20d1f6ae9ec59bf9e6412ba4639523e5adb30f5c092a381fad690e2572
