msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_394AC233_87A7_4B95_AC22_51DFA34BE575"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then, conversely, I wasn’t in a position to be pitied."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫allora, viceversa, non ero nella posizione di essere compatito."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5A62B01D_C5D7_479F_B57A_FA5817CCAE90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8656b081912414caf417b7bb22a037b5e73a464e2e5384201be92bac72099432
#. default-sha256: 13a49e174c99232873b94df440a0c3c91e54ebbedfa1c3f3b80812996cf65c8c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5A62B01D_C5D7_479F_B57A_FA5817CCAE90"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vainly, foolishly trying to convince myself of a lie, ⟪k:1⟫I spent hours, days alone in that "
"tower, holding the dry bones in my arms."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cercando invano di convincermi stupidamente di una bugia,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫trascorsi ore, giorni da "
"solo in quella torre, tenendo quel mucchio⟪k:3⟫di ossa tra le braccia."

#: scenario7:scenario7_128D6A9B_FB57_4B56_80B9_F881B062ADB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e186394b0fa77a03ae2191827f55a367ef1080a441df92516ce9a3f7fe767a14
