msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Over time, the air in the mansion seemed to thicken, as if the fog were "
"condensing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Col tempo, l’aria nella villa pareva inspessirsi, come se la nebbia⟪k:5⟫"
"si stesse condensando."

#: scenario7:scenario7_211FFB6A_7150_4C87_A8C7_A56CC109025D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7086a0d9888cbc9e56afd4071357eafcd368d74e39b62eb9a876ddebc0229a3
