#: scenario7:scenario7_A8B4459A_2076_4A2B_8ECB_5A65EDB9D8F6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57a59d9d3e549a78ff68653f4c02921dbbfb044097b97d88437bfd40a2bd822e
